"""SF4: search jumps to the exact setting. Run from the repo root: python apply_sf4.py   (safe to run twice).
 - static/index.html (the 'Find a setting' search): results can be a single setting (its label inside its card), not only a whole card.
   Tapping one opens the right tab, opens the card if it is folded, scrolls to that field or switch and highlights it. The 'Share my settings' card is found too.
 - the Bot status 'Go to this setting' button now passes the setting's name, so it lands on the exact field of My limits, not just the card.
Nothing is written if any step cannot find its place exactly once."""
